{"id":"disculpa","lemma":"disculpa","pos":"noun","rank":652,"glosses":["excuse","apology"],"ipa":"/disˈkulpa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"disculpas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-disculpa.wav","examples":[{"text":"No hay disculpa para eso.","en":"There's no excuse for that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152225","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Te debo una gran disculpa.","en":"I owe you a big apology.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501325","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"Disculpa un segundo.","en":"Excuse me for a moment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/462038","words":[null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"second"}]},{"text":"Disculpa, ¿qué hora es?","en":"Excuse me, what time is it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519370","words":[null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,4,"what time is it?"]]},{"text":"¿Me disculpa, por favor?","en":"Can you excuse me, please?","words":[{"g":"me"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"please"]]}]}